00:02:08.154 --> 00:02:09.894
THEY’VE ARRESTED MORE THAN 900

00:02:09.895 --> 00:02:11.460
PEOPLE COMING ACROSS THE BORDER

00:02:11.494 --> 00:02:12.740
BUT STEVE, THERE’S SOMETHING

00:02:12.742 --> 00:02:14.137
ELSE, A NEW DYNAMIC ABOUT WHAT’S

00:02:14.172 --> 00:02:15.192
GOING ON ON THE BORDER THAT

00:02:15.193 --> 00:02:16.683
AMERICANS INTO ED TO KNOW ABOUT

00:02:16.685 --> 00:02:18.176
AND THAT IS THE INCREASED

00:02:18.177 --> 00:02:19.144
APPREHENSION OF FENTANYL COMING

00:02:19.145 --> 00:02:20.143
ACROSS THE BORDER.

00:02:20.144 --> 00:02:21.654
YES THERE MAYBE PEOPLE COMING

00:02:21.655 --> 00:02:23.266
ACROSS THE BORDER BUT THERE’S

00:02:23.268 --> 00:02:24.250
DANGEROUS DRUGS COMING ACROSS

00:02:24.284 --> 00:02:27.361
THE BORDER FOR YOUR AUDIENCE WHO

00:02:27.362 --> 00:02:29.797
MAY NOT KNOW, 2 MILLIGRAMS OF

00:02:29.799 --> 00:02:32.092
FENTANYL IS A FATAL DOSE, AND SO

00:02:32.127 --> 00:02:34.285
KNOW THIS.

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:37.420
WE HAD OVER AN 800% INCREASE,

00:02:37.421 --> 00:02:39.403
APRIL OVER APRIL ABOUT THE

00:02:39.404 --> 00:02:41.221
AMOUNT OF FENTANYL THAT HAS

00:02:41.222 --> 00:02:42.847
BEEN APPREHENDED BY THE TEXAS

00:02:42.848 --> 00:02:44.746
