00:02:48.843 --> 00:02:50.701
EVERY SINGLE PERSON IN THE STATE

00:02:50.702 --> 00:02:52.646
OF NEW YORK, AND SO THIS IS A

00:02:52.681 --> 00:02:54.050
VERY DEADLY SITUATION, HAPPENING

00:02:54.084 --> 00:02:55.259
ON THE BORDER.

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:56.361
THE BIDEN ADMINISTRATION BETTER

00:02:56.395 --> 00:02:57.115
WAKE UP.

00:02:57.116 --> 00:02:58.502
HOWEVER, STEVE, THIS IS THE DEAL

00:02:58.536 --> 00:03:00.347
, BECAUSE OF WHAT TEXAS

00:03:00.349 --> 00:03:02.427
IS DOING ON THE BORDER IF TEXAS,

00:03:02.428 --> 00:03:04.845
THAT IS SECURING THE BORDER, WE

00:03:04.846 --> 00:03:06.805
