00:03:06.806 --> 00:03:08.151
STEVE: IT SEEMS FAIR, ABSOLUTELY

00:03:08.152 --> 00:03:09.203
FAIR, BECAUSE YOU’RE DOING THE

00:03:09.204 --> 00:03:10.468
JOB THAT THE FEDERAL

00:03:10.469 --> 00:03:12.437
GOVERNMENT SHOULD BE DOING BUT

00:03:12.438 --> 00:03:13.581
THEY REFUSE TO.

