NOW, IN ADDITION TO YOUR TAKE-

00:03:26.519 --> 00:03:27.813
OUT FOOD YOU’LL BE ABLE TO

00:03:27.815 --> 00:03:30.851
GET A COCKTAIL OR  A BEER OR

00:03:30.852 --> 00:03:32.372
WINE OR  SOMETHING LIKE THAT AS

00:03:32.373 --> 00:03:32.930
WELL.

00:03:32.931 --> 00:03:35.277
&gt;&gt;  WELL FIRST, FOR THE SETTING

00:03:35.279 --> 00:03:37.874
