00:03:37.875 --> 00:03:39.728
NOW, ALL OF OUR RESTAURANTS ARE

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:42.526
100% FULLY OPEN AND THEY HAVE

00:03:42.527 --> 00:03:43.662
