00:03:51.314 --> 00:03:53.640
, AND SO MANY RESTAURANTS

00:03:53.641 --> 00:03:55.048
OWNERS HAVE SAID THAT THIS

00:03:55.049 --> 00:03:56.116
ALCOHOL-TO-GO PROGRAM THAT

00:03:56.117 --> 00:03:57.298
